# Raw per-run artifacts under raw/<device>/... ARE committed (they back every
# RESULTS.md table):
#   runN.log        — sanitized by run.sh at capture time to ONLY the
#                     perf/marker lines stats.py parses (frust-perf /
#                     flutter-perf / bench-scenario-*). Full-device logcat
#                     never persists.
#   *.pss_*.txt     — `dumpsys meminfo <our bench pkg>` snapshots (S7 memory
#                     axis); scoped to our own app's process only.
#   stats.txt       — the run.sh stdout tail from its `-- stats.py` banner
#                     onward (the stats.py p50=/p95=/frames:/missed_* table
#                     for that scenario's kept runs); whitelist-checked
#                     line-by-line the same way as runN.log, by
#                     ab_matrix.sh's self_check_raw_dir.
# Pre-commit verification (conductor runs both):
#   grep -rlvE 'frust-perf|flutter-perf|bench-scenario|^[[:space:]]*$' raw/ --include='*.log'   (expect no output)
#   scan *.pss_*.txt for any package identifier other than it.f0x.*bench     (expect none)
# Transient capture scratch (pre-sanitize) — never committed:
*.unfiltered
*.console.txt
*.container.txt
